damaged_code:
```rust
let not_ready: bool = false;

if !not_ready {
    println!("Proceeding...");
}
```

counterexample:
Using positive booleans that can be negated cleanly at the call site:
```rust
let is_ready: bool = true;
if is_ready { ... }
```

fix:
Refactor the boolean to represent the positive state of the entity.
```rust
let is_ready: bool = true;

if is_ready {
    println!("Proceeding...");
}
```
